   "stem": "A hospital pharmacy is building a cleanroom suite for compounding non-hazardous sterile preparations. The ante-room opens only into a positive-pressure buffer room, which contains a laminar airflow workbench as the primary engineering control (PEC). Under USP General Chapter 797, what minimum ISO air cleanliness class is required for the PEC, the buffer room and the ante-room?",
