    "A": "Injectable influenza vaccine is inactivated and is recommended every season for immunosuppressed patients. Only the live attenuated nasal influenza vaccine should be avoided.",
    "B": "Pneumococcal conjugate vaccine is not live and is recommended for immunocompromised adults, who are at higher risk of invasive pneumococcal disease.",
